OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy with some patchy rain to start
OL,7,Fthis evening. However, it will become
OL,8,Fdry with clear periods developing for
OL,9,Fa while overnight. Isolated fog
OL,10,Fpatches possible in prone rural spots.
OL,11,FWinds easing for a time overnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FFor many, Sunday promises to
OL,14,Fbe a much drier and brighter day than
OL,15,FSaturday with sunny spells. However
OL,16,Fone or two showers possible by
OL,17,Fafternoon in the gusty southwesterly
OL,18,Fbreeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
