OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,6,Fand Tuesday look mild, cloudy and
OL,7,Fwindy with the chance of some
OL,8,Foccasionally heavy rain. The rain
OL,9,Fshould clear to leave a sunnier, less
OL,10,Fwindy day on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
